cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "grafana-llmops-forge"
version: 2.0.5
date-released: "2026-10-27"
abstract: >-
  Discovers the LLM telemetry a Grafana deployment actually collects
  (OpenTelemetry GenAI, LiteLLM, vLLM/TGI, DCGM), then generates and deploys
  dashboards for LLM FinOps, agents, quality and AI governance, captures their
  rendering for a separate optional visual review, and provides multi-window
  burn-rate SLO alerts plus an EU AI Act, ISO/IEC 42001 and NIST AI RMF
  evidence layer.
